      "statement": "Home Manager installs the pi-box wrapper, substitutes the pinned Pi version 1.4.0, deploys the base Dockerfile at ~/.pi/sandbox/Dockerfile, and recursively deploys the repository template catalog under ~/.pi/sandbox/templates; the NixOS configuration separately enables rootless Docker.",
